{"title":"The Vietnam War and racial integration","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/949690019/0/marginalrevolution~The-Vietnam-War-and-racial-integration.html","date":1772868869000,"content":"<blockquote><p>The Vietnam draft conscripted hundreds of thousands of young Americans into an integrated military. I combine near-random draft lottery variation with administrative voter data to study the long-run racial integration effects of coerced national service. Black and Native American veterans became more likely to marry white spouses, identify as Republicans, and live in more-integrated neighborhoods. Improved economic standing may partly mediate these effects. Effects are larger for Southerners and are precisely null for white veterans. Coerced military service generates substantial but asymmetric cross-racial political convergence and racial integration: Vietnam-era service caused about 20 percent of affected cohorts’ interracial marriages.</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>That is from <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.nber.org/papers/w34900\" target=\"_blank\">a recent NBER working paper</a> by Zachary Bleemer.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/03/the-vietnam-war-and-racial-integration.html\">The Vietnam War and racial integration</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/949690019/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/949690019/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/949690019/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/949690019/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/949690019/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/949690019/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/03/the-vietnam-war-and-racial-integration.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/03/the-vietnam-war-and-racial-integration.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a> \r\n<div><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/03/the-vietnam-war-and-racial-integration.html#comments\"><h3>Comments</h3></a><ul><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/03/the-vietnam-war-and-racial-integration.html#comment-161023897\">In reply to Cog.   President Vegetable and Slick Willie and W ...</a> <i>by dearieme</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/03/the-vietnam-war-and-racial-integration.html#comment-161023891\">In reply to ARAD.   But it's not “equality of opportunity” ...</a> <i>by Wayfaring Stranger</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/03/the-vietnam-war-and-racial-integration.html#comment-161023884\">In reply to Hadur.   Is that because of where you live? Or do ...</a> <i>by Sashoir</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/03/the-vietnam-war-and-racial-integration.html#comment-161023873\">In reply to superdestroyer.   I suspect the force of the ...</a> <i>by ARAD</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/03/the-vietnam-war-and-racial-integration